# AttackerUnblocked: Crypt Cobra attacks and is not blocked, so the defender
# gets a poison counter (CR 508.1 declare blockers, then the trigger resolves);
# the 3 combat damage still comes off the life total.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
resolvestack
advance
advance
combatdamage
